### Admin logs search - 금지된 DSL 키(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_QUERY)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "script": { "source": "ctx._source.level='ERROR'" },
  "size": 10
}

