Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-04-01T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "size": 10
}

### Admin logs field-summary - 허용되지 않은 field(400, ADMIN_LOGS_INVALID_FIELD)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["password"]
}

### Admin logs field-summary - 확장 화이트리스트 + size 50
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/field-summary
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "fields": ["metadata.funnel_name", "metadata.step_name", "metadata.entry_type", "path"],
  "size": 50
}

### Admin logs histogram - groupBy 추가(metadata.funnel_name 분포)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/histogram
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groupBy": "metadata.funnel_name"
}

### Admin logs terms-with-subs - 깔때기 시작/완료 분기 카운트
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/terms-with-subs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groupBy": "metadata.funnel_name",
  "size": 10,
  "subFilters": [
    { "name": "started", "query": "event_name:funnel_step_completed AND metadata.step_name:(settings OR birth_info)" },
    { "name": "completed", "query": "event_name:funnel_goal_reached" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs terms-with-metric - 경로별 평균 체류 시간
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/terms-with-metric
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "event_name:page_view_completed",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groupBy": "path",
  "size": 30,
  "metrics": [
    { "type": "avg", "field": "metadata.time_on_page_ms", "name": "avgMs" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs terms-with-metric - funnel별 distinct uuid (cardinality)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/terms-with-metric
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "event_name:funnel_step_completed",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groupBy": "metadata.funnel_name",
  "size": 10,
  "metrics": [
    { "type": "cardinality", "field": "uuid", "name": "uniqueUsers" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs composite-buckets - 첫 페이지(funnel_name + step_name)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/composite-buckets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "sources": ["metadata.funnel_name", "metadata.step_name"],
  "size": 200,
  "subAggs": [
    { "type": "min", "field": "metadata.step_index", "name": "minStepIndex" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs composite-buckets - funnel 단계별 distinct uuid (cardinality subAgg)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/composite-buckets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "event_name:funnel_step_completed",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "sources": ["metadata.funnel_name", "metadata.step_name"],
  "size": 200,
  "subAggs": [
    { "type": "min", "field": "metadata.step_index", "name": "minStepIndex" },
    { "type": "cardinality", "field": "uuid", "name": "uniqueUsers" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs composite-buckets - afterKey 페이지네이션
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/composite-buckets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "sources": ["metadata.funnel_name", "metadata.step_name"],
  "size": 200,
  "after": {
    "metadata.funnel_name": "relay_room_creation",
    "metadata.step_name": "settings"
  }
}

### Admin logs filtered-metrics - 이탈 단계별 평균 대기/소요 시간
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/filtered-metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groups": [
    { "name": "lobby",    "query": "event_name:room_lobby_abandoned",   "metric": { "type": "avg", "field": "metadata.wait_time_ms" } },
    { "name": "creation", "query": "event_name:creation_abandoned",     "metric": { "type": "avg", "field": "metadata.elapsed_ms" } },
    { "name": "result",   "query": "event_name:result_share_abandoned", "metric": { "type": "avg", "field": "metadata.time_on_result_ms" } }
  ]
}

### Admin logs filtered-metrics - 메트릭 없이 카운트만
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/filtered-metrics
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "groups": [
    { "name": "page_view",      "query": "event_name:page_view_started" },
    { "name": "page_completed", "query": "event_name:page_view_completed" }
  ]
}

### Admin logs distinct-count - 활성 uuid 수
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/logs/distinct-count
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

{
  "index": "biz-events",
  "query": "",
  "filters": [],
  "timeRange": {
    "from": "2026-05-14T00:00:00Z",
    "to": "2026-05-15T00:00:00Z"
  },
  "field": "uuid",
  "precisionThreshold": 3000
}

